---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getUrl } from '../../utils/nav';
---

<BaseLayout title="Branding Studio MVP Validation" description="Project detail">
  <main class="page-shell project-detail-shell">
    <article class="project-detail">
      <div class="project-header">
        <a href={getUrl('/projects')} class="back-link"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> All case studies</a>
        <h1>Branding Studio MVP Validation</h1>
        <p class="project-intro">Tested an early-stage studio offering with prospective customers to determine whether the offer matched real demand and delivery constraints.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="project-meta-grid">
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="meta-label">Client:</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Branding services product team</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="meta-label">Role:</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Research lead</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="meta-label">Focus:</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Qualitative validation, concept testing, pricing conversations</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="meta-label">Preview:</span>
          <a href="#" class="meta-link">View project →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-content">
        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>Validating product-market fit for a new service offering</h2>
          <p>The team had an MVP branding studio offering and needed to understand whether the market demand matched their delivery model and pricing assumptions. We conducted qualitative research with prospective customers to test the offer and identify adoption barriers.</p>
          <p>The research revealed gaps between the team's assumptions and customer needs, which helped them refine the MVP and clarify their market narrative. This work accelerated the path to market and reduced the risk of a misaligned launch.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
